// title: "Highway build collections"
// summary: "Select the implemented native crossing, compact diamond, or modular ramp kit without importing rail assumptions."
//
// Used when: The library loads highway build selections, and a contributor explicitly selects a named collection with --set for doctor, build, or release-check.
//
// Read by: custom-pieces/framework/scp/catalog.py load_catalog() follows the collections field in the highway domain registry and merges these named member lists into piece_sets; custom-pieces/scp.py selection() resolves an explicitly requested set to existing piece IDs.
//
// Updated by: Contributors author reviewed lists of already registered reusable piece IDs; custom-pieces/framework/scp/registration.py apply_registration() also writes supplied collection changes using the header-preserving JSONC writer.
//
// Affects: Which existing types an explicit named build selection includes and how collections appear in generated domain navigation; a collection allocates no new piece, defines no assembly placement plan, and creates no additional construction button.
//
// Reference: custom-pieces/docs/BUILD_AND_INSTALL.md
